    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>This buffer implementation has four stages:
- No data
- Bytes-based buffer
- BytesIO-based buffer
- Temporary file storage
The first two stages are fastest for simple transfers.
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
